{"session_log":"session.v3.jsonl","event":{"type":"tool/result","seq":38,"time":1790247326888,"data":{"turn":1,"step":4,"message":{"source":{"kind":"tool","callId":"call_00_ltvBgAaKAb4z2UKAr4P12183"},"content":[{"type":"tool-result","toolCallId":"call_00_ltvBgAaKAb4z2UKAr4P12183","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<path>/work/harness/workspace/.agents/skills/fault-analysis/SKILL.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: ---\n2: name: fault-analysis\n3: description: \"使用已授权的 SOC 只读工具调查资产、事件、路径、覆盖与可达性问题；只取证和分析，不创建运行或执行处置。\"\n4: ---\n5: \n6: # 故障排查\n7: \n8: 主 Agent 识别到访问异常、资产异常、事件关联、拓扑路径、覆盖或可达性问题后，通过 `delegate_fault_analysis` 委派。子 Agent 只调用完成当前问题必需的工具，并以工具当前 `inputSchema` 为准提供参数。\n9: \n10: ## 可用工具\n11: \n12: - 资产发现与解析：`mcp__sec-ops__search_graph_assets`、`mcp__sec-ops__get_graph_resolve_ip_host`、`mcp__sec-ops__get_soc_asset_by_asset_id`、`mcp__sec-ops__list_soc_asset`\n13: - 资产上下文：`mcp__sec-ops__get_soc_asset_biz_systems`、`mcp__sec-ops__get_soc_asset_vulnerabilities`、`mcp__sec-ops__get_ingest_devices_by_asset_by_asset_id`\n14: - 拓扑与路径：`mcp__sec-ops__get_graph_node_detail`、`mcp__sec-ops__get_graph_path_query`、`mcp__sec-ops__get_reachability_path_by_ip`、`mcp__sec-ops__get_graph_flow_host_pair_ports`、`mcp__sec-ops__get_reachability_cross_signal`\n15: - 覆盖与事件：`mcp__sec-ops__get_graph_compliance_violations`、`mcp__sec-ops__get_graph_coverage`、`mcp__sec-ops__get_event_by_id`\n16: \n17: ## 工作方式\n18: \n19: 1. 从当前请求确认对象、异常、时间或事件标识；缺失的必要参数只询问一次。\n20: 2. 选择最少的相关工具，先解析对象，再按问题查询路径、资产、覆盖或事件证据。\n21: 3. 将无数据、工具错误和否定证据分开记录；不得把缺失数据解释为正常或异常。\n22: 4. 输出事实、推断、证据缺口和未执行建议。不得调用写工具、创建分析运行、读取文件、执行命令或补造工具结果。\n\n(End of file - total 22 lines)\n</content>"}],"isError":false}],"role":"user","id":"6ba3e77c-ad8d-4d38-9370-637bd31c8b3e"},"meta":{"path":"/work/harness/workspace/.agents/skills/fault-analysis/SKILL.md","offset":1,"lines":[{"number":1,"text":"---"},{"number":2,"text":"name: fault-analysis"},{"number":3,"text":"description: \"使用已授权的 SOC 只读工具调查资产、事件、路径、覆盖与可达性问题；只取证和分析，不创建运行或执行处置。\""},{"number":4,"text":"---"},{"number":5,"text":""},{"number":6,"text":"# 故障排查"},{"number":7,"text":""},{"number":8,"text":"主 Agent 识别到访问异常、资产异常、事件关联、拓扑路径、覆盖或可达性问题后，通过 `delegate_fault_analysis` 委派。子 Agent 只调用完成当前问题必需的工具，并以工具当前 `inputSchema` 为准提供参数。"},{"number":9,"text":""},{"number":10,"text":"## 可用工具"},{"number":11,"text":""},{"number":12,"text":"- 资产发现与解析：`mcp__sec-ops__search_graph_assets`、`mcp__sec-ops__get_graph_resolve_ip_host`、`mcp__sec-ops__get_soc_asset_by_asset_id`、`mcp__sec-ops__list_soc_asset`"},{"number":13,"text":"- 资产上下文：`mcp__sec-ops__get_soc_asset_biz_systems`、`mcp__sec-ops__get_soc_asset_vulnerabilities`、`mcp__sec-ops__get_ingest_devices_by_asset_by_asset_id`"},{"number":14,"text":"- 拓扑与路径：`mcp__sec-ops__get_graph_node_detail`、`mcp__sec-ops__get_graph_path_query`、`mcp__sec-ops__get_reachability_path_by_ip`、`mcp__sec-ops__get_graph_flow_host_pair_ports`、`mcp__sec-ops__get_reachability_cross_signal`"},{"number":15,"text":"- 覆盖与事件：`mcp__sec-ops__get_graph_compliance_violations`、`mcp__sec-ops__get_graph_coverage`、`mcp__sec-ops__get_event_by_id`"},{"number":16,"text":""},{"number":17,"text":"## 工作方式"},{"number":18,"text":""},{"number":19,"text":"1. 从当前请求确认对象、异常、时间或事件标识；缺失的必要参数只询问一次。"},{"number":20,"text":"2. 选择最少的相关工具，先解析对象，再按问题查询路径、资产、覆盖或事件证据。"},{"number":21,"text":"3. 将无数据、工具错误和否定证据分开记录；不得把缺失数据解释为正常或异常。"},{"number":22,"text":"4. 输出事实、推断、证据缺口和未执行建议。不得调用写工具、创建分析运行、读取文件、执行命令或补造工具结果。"}],"totalLines":22,"lang":"md"}},"sourceEventSeqs":[37],"surfaceOp":"append"}}
